The master's modifiers placed in its chain (Segno: docs/design/modulators.md §5, ADR 0061).

The custom-modifiers patch places a track's modifiers among its plugins (ProcessingPosition::
beforePlugin); the master's chain was built without them. Its modifier list now goes with its
plugins the same way, and a modifier on the master may hear another track (the
modifier-sidechain patch).

diff '--color=auto' -ru a/modules/tracktion_engine/playback/graph/tracktion_EditNodeBuilder.cpp b/modules/tracktion_engine/playback/graph/tracktion_EditNodeBuilder.cpp
